<section class="harbor-mailbox" aria-labelledby="mailboxTitle">
  <details class="harbor-letter" id="guestbook">
    <summary><span class="harbor-letter__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 32" fill="none"><rect x="2" y="3" width="36" height="26" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="m3 5 17 13L37 5M3 27l11-10m23 10L26 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></span><span class="harbor-letter__summary"><small>DOCKSIDE MAILBOX · 码头信箱</small><strong id="mailboxTitle">来过，就留一封信吧。</strong><span>一句问候、一个建议，或是你的博客地址。</span></span><span class="harbor-letter__toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
    <div class="harbor-letter__body">
      <div class="harbor-letter__aside"><span class="harbor-letter__to">TO SUNNY,</span><p>远方的朋友：<br />谢谢你把这艘小船<br />当成旅途中的一站。</p><span class="harbor-letter__signature">见字如面。</span><a href="https://github.com/sunny-0501/sunny-0501.github.io/issues?q=is%3Aissue+%E7%95%99%E8%A8%80" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看公开来信 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <form class="guestbook-form harbor-note-form" id="guestbookForm" action="https://github.com/sunny-0501/sunny-0501.github.io/issues/new" method="get" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <label for="guestbookName">怎么称呼你<input id="guestbookName" name="title" type="text" maxlength="40" placeholder="你的昵称" autocomplete="nickname" required /></label>
        <label for="guestbookMessage">想说的话<textarea id="guestbookMessage" name="body" rows="4" maxlength="1200" placeholder="你好，sunny！今天路过这里……" aria-describedby="guestbookCount" required></textarea></label>
        <div class="harbor-note-form__bottom"><p class="harbor-note-form__hint">使用 GitHub 留言，需要登录后确认发布。</p><span id="guestbookCount" class="harbor-note-form__count">0 / 1200</span></div>
        <button class="publish-button harbor-send" type="submit">前往 GitHub 寄信 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        <p class="static-note">点击后会打开填好内容的 GitHub 页面，在那里确认后才会公开。也可<a href="mailto:2522015679@qq.com">发一封邮件</a>。</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>
